rogress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama"],"id":9942,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Boys Over Flowers: Final","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk47/shows/6ca1f416-c7cc-4ede-8c83-3dedb069595b.jpg","background_image":"","likes":40,"dislikes":0,"views":5246,"release_date":"1214611200000","length":7875,"description":"Boys Over Flowers Final is the third and final chapter of the Boys Over Flowers trilogy based on the Japanese comic series Hana Yori Dango written by Yoko Kamio. Makino and Domyoji have decided to marry, but are they really ready to take that step? They embark on a multi-country journey that determines if the couple's love merits a lifetime commitment to each other. Thank goodness this couple has the support of the F4 (Flower Four), 4 close friends (Domyoji, Rui, Soujiroh, Akira) as they face many challenges. Boys Over Flowers Final (Hana Yori Dango Final) is the 2008 movie that is third chapter in the trilogy. The first chapter in the trilogy is Boys Over Flowers (Hana Yori Dango), the 2005 9 episodes 2005 television drama series. The second chapter in the trilogy is Boys Over Flowers 2 (Hana Yori Dango Returns) the 2007 11 episode television drama series.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.1}],"value":7.1,"age":"pg-13"},"episode_id":9942,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}